# ViRent design tokens

## Colors (HSL channels — see `resources/css/app.css`)

### Light mode
- Primary: `162 72% 32%` (teal) — logo, navigation, primary buttons
- Accent: `162 60% 92%` (pale teal) — highlights, card top borders
- Destructive: `0 72% 51%` — cancellation, errors
- Background: `0 0% 99%` · Foreground: `222 14% 11%`
- Muted: `220 14% 96%` — secondary surfaces, placeholders

### Dark mode
- Primary: `162 55% 45%` (lighter teal)
- Accent: `162 40% 18%` · Accent foreground: `162 55% 75%`
- Background: `222 15% 8%` · Foreground: `210 20% 96%`

Always use semantic Tailwind classes (`text-primary`, `bg-accent`, etc.) — never hardcode hex in components.

## Status badge colors
pending→amber · confirmed→blue · active→primary · completed→green · cancelled→destructive · maintenance→gray

## Typography
- Heading: Space Grotesk (self-hosted woff2)
- Body/UI: Inter (self-hosted woff2)
- Wordmark: Unbounded (self-hosted woff2), uppercase, weight 700
- Identifiers (license plate, booking ref, VIN): JetBrains Mono

## Logo
Wordmark only — "ViRent", Unbounded uppercase, `text-primary`. No icon.

NEVER import from Google Fonts CDN — self-hosted woff2 only, `font-display: swap`.
